{"kind":"assert","text":"EK1 design for planner review: one private shared value check keeps prefix→use guards→tail order; one Explore-only absent-fresh value enters the unsigned body and never recordable authority. Any observes row under that selected value stays unavailable. No code or execution; gate position follows AE1 and C4.","body":{"boundary":"Please adopt the shared lazy private continuation and the body-only input/output boundary before source. Current judge.ts507 returns its selected grant directly; the new absent-fresh value must be omitted from recordable Grant[] without a Grant cast. Preserve ordinary and prediction grants with an own fresh member, including null. No new runtime/replay/Contract source or wire change is proposed.","evidence":"Existing compound-refusal order case before/after, body and observes cases, one meaningful observes-stop control, compile-only exclusions plus unchanged isGrant refusal, maintained E1 compare with capture unset and unchanged answers/fixtures, whole definition corpus, owner-dated16Nov kernel§7 paragraph. All planned only; no source implementation, corpus capture/adoption, Client/MCP/session acquisition or E2/E3 release.","proposal":"Root read complete SUMMARY.md4472B SHA0c82b73f89a768753129c88aaac9a31fde476ee5803a9963b031c34e6f231c21 and full PLAN.md SHA8486fda9da044c2422bdedc65055a5d694adf6b2a7bda126aa127893855a9876 in /private/tmp/artroom-ek1-standing-value-design-20261116. Raw bindings534bb4494cba07fc9826ffb9bf7f936b121d147fe22d81849e9a29f465dd53a7.","summary":"# EK1 design for review\n\nRequest `c4856f3a2eb594a5806cfa4e3fe6f41dc90adaa0`, promise `5a7fcb9ed6fecb1c7024a81566c5249b58c9f331`; owner exception dated **16 November 2026**. No implementation or execution. Side gate after AE1 and C4.\n\n**One check, unchanged precedence.** In grant.ts, one private value-check body owns membership/incarnation → key → revocation, then invokes a private synchronous continuation, then checks key-state → action → within → not